## 11. Full Function Call Chain

```
Dashboard.tsx mounts
│
├─ loadStatus()
│   ├─ api.ts::getStatus(city.id)
│   │   └─ GET /status?cityId=bengaluru
│   │       └─ routes/status.js
│   │           ├─ EnvironmentalData.findOne({ cityId }).sort({ date: -1 })
│   │           │   └─ MongoDB query → latest record
│   │           └─ engine/cascadeEngine.js::computeRisk(latest, 0)
│   │               ├─ engine/dataProcessor.js::normalizeAll(rawData)
│   │               │   ├─ normalizeAQI(aqi)           = aqi / 500
│   │               │   ├─ normalizeTraffic(traffic)   = traffic / 100
│   │               │   ├─ normalizeWater(water_quality) = (100 - wq) / 100
│   │               │   └─ normalizeEmissions(industry) = industry / 100
│   │               └─ runCascade(normalized, heatwaveLevel=0)
│   │                   ├─ Iteration 1,2,3: Markov propagation
│   │                   │   Risk_next = BaseRisk + 0.8 × Σ(Risk × AdjacencyWeight)
│   │                   ├─ risk_score = 0.40×aqi + 0.25×water + 0.20×health + 0.15×traffic
│   │                   ├─ confidence_interval = risk ± margin
│   │                   └─ triggered_systems (threshold 0.60)
│   │
│   └─ Dashboard.tsx::loadStatus (after api.ts transform)
│       ├─ apply city.riskMultiplier to all values
│       ├─ re-derive triggered_systems from scaled values
│       ├─ re-derive crisis_level from scaled risk
│       └─ setStatus(scaledData)  → re-renders Panels 1,2,3,4
│
├─ loadHistory()
│   ├─ api.ts::getHistoryRaw(city.id)
│   │   └─ GET /history?cityId=bengaluru
│   │       └─ routes/history.js
│   │           ├─ MongoDB aggregation pipeline (group by day, limit 7)
│   │           └─ for each day: cascadeEngine.js::computeRisk(rec, 0)
│   │
│   └─ Dashboard.tsx maps to HistoryChartPoint[]
│       ├─ label, aqi, water_quality, traffic (raw)
│       └─ risk_pct = risk_score × riskMultiplier × 100
│           → setHistoryData(points)  → re-renders Panel 5
│
└─ WebSocket
    └─ ws.onmessage: RISK_UPDATE
        ├─ sensor simulator computed computeRisk() server-side
        └─ setStatus(prev → updated aqi, traffic, water, emissions)
            → live update of Panels 1 and 4
```

