## 12. All Formulas Used in the Dashboard

| Formula | Where Used | What It Computes |
|---------|-----------|-----------------|
| `aqi / 500` | dataProcessor.js | AQI risk (0–1) |
| `(100 - water_quality) / 100` | dataProcessor.js | Water risk — **inverted** (lower quality = higher risk) |
| `traffic / 100` | dataProcessor.js | Traffic risk (0–1) |
| `industry_emission / 100` | dataProcessor.js | Emissions risk (0–1) |
| `BaseRisk + 0.8 × Σ(Risk × Weight)` | cascadeEngine.js | Cascade propagation per node per iteration |
| `0.40×AQI + 0.25×Water + 0.20×Health + 0.15×Traffic` | cascadeEngine.js | **Composite risk score** |
| `sin(Date.now()/10000) × 0.04` | cascadeEngine.js | Dynamic confidence interval variance |
| `risk ± margin × risk` | cascadeEngine.js | Confidence interval lower/upper bounds |
| `(CRISIS_THRESHOLD - risk) / 0.05` | cascadeEngine.js | Time-to-impact estimate |
| `rawRisk × city.riskMultiplier` | Dashboard.tsx | City-scaled risk score |
| `city.baseAqi + (rawAqi - 98) × multiplier` | Dashboard.tsx | City-scaled AQI display |
| `rawCascade × multiplier` (clamped 0–1) | Dashboard.tsx | City-scaled water/health/traffic |
| `scaled >= 0.60` | Dashboard.tsx | Re-derive triggered systems |
| `risk_score × multiplier × 100` | Dashboard.tsx | Risk % for chart |
| `lastRisk - firstRisk` | history.js | Trend delta |
| `abs(delta) < 0.05` | history.js | STABLE / WORSENING / IMPROVING |
| `industry_emission × 3` | api.ts | Emission index → approximate kg/h |
| `traffic / 100` | api.ts | % → 0–1 normalization |
| `water_quality / 100` | api.ts | % → 0–1 normalization |
| `(Math.random()-0.5) × 0.05 × max` | sensorSimulator.js | Sensor ±2.5% drift per tick |
